    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38586" root="مسخ" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَمْسُوخٌ</span></b>  A horse, <i>having little flesh in the
rump,</i> or <i>buttocks:</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَمْسُوخَةٌ العَجُزِ</span> A
woman <i>having little flesh in her posteriors:</i> (K:)
but the more approved pronunciation is with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ح</span>.
(TA.)

